## 模式

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Your Agent
  participant MIOSA API
  participant Sandbox

  Your Agent->>MIOSA API: create sandbox
  MIOSA API->>Sandbox: boot microVM
  Your Agent->>MIOSA API: files.write(path, content)
  Your Agent->>MIOSA API: exec("npm run build")
